      "message": "With the current CL structure, I think this CL will break the build for boards like rex, where there will be two versions of discovery responses linked in. You can check by building screebo at this commit without the next one.\n\nOptions:\n1. In this CL, explicitly disable this config for all of the boards that have their own implementation. That would make this CL a no-op. Then, in later CLs, remove the redundant implementation and the config from each board.\n2. Remove all of the custom implementations in this CL.\n\nI would lean toward option 1, because it will make for smaller CLs to review.",
